<p>Chinese-made humanoid robots ran a half-marathon in Beijing on Sunday, and the fastest machine finished the 21-kilometer course in 50 minutes and 26 seconds — faster than the human half-marathon world record cited by the outlets. That marked a sharp improvement from the race&#x27;s inaugural edition a year earlier, when many robots struggled even to get off the starting line and most failed to finish.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Iv5XGyGjvEpBYXVNyN3SOTwtL607mZj6QAOc_IAMSHkgvKGg-_bHyVEBshgR5owttkElYdl-lbgOgm2coMm_4fQvYMMBDnfc4zazo-komBESO_nYBCskSto1SuLyB9CHfddg3Gd2CzFTUnAsnPpmSSpqkvYKp6c' alt='Humanoid robots take part in the Beijing half-marathon event.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Field size: The Guardian said more than 100 robots took part, making the Beijing event a broad public test rather than a one-robot exhibition.</li><li>Fresh benchmark: Uganda&#x27;s Jacob Kiplimo set the human half-marathon record used for comparison in Lisbon only last month, which made the robot&#x27;s sub-51-minute result stand out even more in coverage.</li><li>Consumer-tech crossover: The Hindu said the winning robot was developed by Chinese smartphone brand Honor, tying the result to a consumer electronics company rather than a specialist robotics firm.</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/apr/19/humanoid-robots-race-beijing-half-marathon'>Humanoid robots show rapid advances as they race past humans in Beijing half-marathon</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/video-faster-than-humans-chinese-humanoid-robots-impress-with-record-times-in-beijing-half-marathon-11378275#publisher=newsstand'>Watch: In A First, Chinese Humanoid Robots Outrun Humans In Beijing Half-Marathon</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/humanoid-robot-sprints-victory-beijing-beating-human-half-132179294'>Humanoid robot sprints to victory in Beijing, beating human half-marathon record</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/sci-tech/humanoid-robots-race-past-humans-in-beijing-half-marathon-showing-rapid-advances/article70880082.ece'>Humanoid robots race past humans in Beijing half-marathon, showing rapid advances</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>